Required Skills🛹

• Excellent command of the pc (email and Office package);
• Good knowledge of English;
• Good organisational skills;
• Problem solving skills;
• Strong attitude to the relationship with the public;
• Preferably car owner.
• We require availability for a part-time position in the morning

